<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\チャイム.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\教室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"All right, it took 3 minutes for everyone to be quiet. 
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
Listen, everyone, next year you'll be junior high students. 
{PAUSE ""}
Look at <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>, she's been waiting quietly ever since I came in, hasn't she?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"Today, it's the birthday of that very <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ooh...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE>, so it was your birthday!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Congratulations! <STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"Come on, <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>, try saying something, just a few words?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いちむら">Ichimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-sensei. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Thank you for your words of congratulation."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE>, congratulations!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The genius girl's birthday, hooray!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE>, I wonder what she'll be when she grows up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"She's a genius, so, a scientist or something?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Going to space!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"I wish I could've been a genius too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, no, <STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE> is in another dimension, so no way for you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sensei, how can I become a genius like <STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE>, you can speak English and other languages too, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I heard she can even solve high school arithmetic!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"In high school they call it mathematics, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, for <STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE> that's probably a given."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"All right, all right, everyone, <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> works hard where nobody sees it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone, you too, work hard so you don't lose to <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>, and become fine junior high students, all right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okaaay!"<BR>
"Okaaay!"<BR>
"Okaaay!"<BR>
"Okaaay!"<BR>
"Okaaay!"<BR>
"Okaaay!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
